dialogs
0	Whew… I'm just bushed…I hiked over from MAUVILLE CITY. But, boy, this city's huge.If I'd known this, I would've ridden my BIKE here.
1	STERN, the fellow who built the MUSEUM, also happens to be the leader of an undersea exploration team.So, everyone calls him CAPT. STERN.
2	Wroooar! I'm going to compete in the BATTLE TENT, too!But before that, I need to catch some POKéMON!
3	What is that over there? That long line…
4	Hey, there! Quit pushing! This is the line, can't you see?
5	Ooh, look at this!The seaweed you can get around these parts is fresh and full of life.Why, it looks like it can even rear up and attack!
6	Where the water is clean, the fruits of bountiful harvest gather.And where people gather, a market soon starts.That is how a town is born and grows.
7	Shopping where you can breathe the scent of the ocean…SLATEPORT is such a wonderful place!
8	TY: Okay, CAPT. STERN, a big smile for the camera!
9	GABBY: I see, I see. You've had a most invaluable experience…
10	CAPT. STERN: Yes, indeed. We intend to move ahead with our exploration.
11	The sea is just so vast…Could the sea have been made by the tears shed by POKéMON?
12	Do you know what they do with old ships that become too creaky to sail?They sink them in the sea so they become habitats for POKéMON.
13	Whenever I visit here, I get carried away and buy too much.
14	Recently, a BATTLE TENT was built in SLATEPORT.GYMS are fun, but the BATTLE TENT's awesome in its own way.You should go find tough POKéMON for the BATTLE TENT!
15	If you want to change your POKéMON's nickname, you'll have to get the NAME RATER to help you.
16	Any POKéMON you get in a trade, you can't change its nickname.The original TRAINER's love for that POKéMON is in the nickname.
17	TEAM AQUA has a policy of assembling and dispersing at the operation site.
18	Our BOSS is brilliant.What would he want to do with a MUSEUM now?
21	The light of the lighthouse reaches dozens of miles away.I wonder if it doesn't startle POKéMON in the sea.
22	Oh? Your …
25	What's the new scheme, I wonder?Our BOSS is scary when he's mad, so I'd better not screw things up…
26	If there's something we need in the MUSEUM, we should take it all!
27	Hey, you there! Don't butt in!
28	A long line, huh?It reminds me of the times I lined up to buy smash-hit games…
29	Why are we even lining up and paying? We should just march in!
30	What? What do you want?
31	Grumble…I should've brought my Game Boy Advance so I wouldn't get bored in line…Grumble…
32	When this operation's over, I'll take you to a hot spring spa!That's what our leader said. I can't wait!
33	If a wild POKéMON gets hurt, it heals itself by chewing on BERRIES.Did you know that?Somebody saw that and got the idea of making medicine from BERRIES.Did you know that?To turn BERRIES into medicine, they must be crushed into powder.Did you know that?You seem to have an interest in BERRIES!I've got something good for someone like you.
