= SlateportCity_EventScript_ExplainBerryPowder
msgbox	I recently had machines installed at POKéMON CENTERS for crushing BERRIES.The BERRY CRUSH machines are at the DIRECT CORNER upstairs.Did you know?Could you make BERRY POWDER for me using those machines?I can make you all sorts of medicine if you bring me lots of BERRY POWDER.
release
